-- =============================================================================
-- Register reset: BATCH 1 only
--
-- Replaces the entire drawing_items register (previously seeded from the ORIG
-- sheet, which did not match what is actually being tracked) with exactly the
-- 45 items on the client Excel's "Batch 1" tab — no other tabs. Every item
-- is tagged batch='BATCH 1'; category holds the finer equipment-type grouping
-- from that tab (Main Switchgear, Admin/Residential Panelboards, Busbar Gutter,
-- Circuit Breaker Gutter, Enclosed Circuit Breaker).
--
-- Deleting drawing_items cascades to drawing_pdfs and review_history, so any
-- assignment/upload/review history on the old (wrong) register is cleared too —
-- confirmed intentional ("reset the assignment").
--
-- Item numbers are prefixed "B1-" (Batch 2 items are prefixed "B2-" in
-- 11_batch2_register.sql) so item_no stays globally unique and visually
-- consistent across both award batches.
--
-- NOTE: this file deletes the *entire* register, Batch 2 included — do not
-- re-run it once Batch 2 is live. If you just need to rename already-live
-- Batch 1 rows to the "B1-" prefix without touching anything else, use
-- 12_rename_batch1_prefix.sql instead.
-- =============================================================================

delete from drawing_items;

